Third-party notices for the container hook's bundle

Container hook version: 0.8.1

/usr/local/lib/billet/container-hook/upstream.js is the index.js of actions/runner-container-hooks v0.8.1 (the release asset actions-runner-hooks-docker-0.8.1.zip, which internal/guestassets/container-hook.pin names by digest). @vercel/ncc built it as one file from that project's packages/docker and packages/hooklib, whose license is container-hook.LICENSE beside this file, and from the npm packages below, at the versions the tag's packages/docker/package-lock.json resolves. Each package is under the MIT license, which asks for its notice with every copy, so each is reproduced here as the LICENSE file in its npm tarball, read on 2026-10-18 from a tarball whose sha512 matched the lockfile's integrity.

The copyright comments the bundle keeps inline, for the code undici adapted from ws, Node.js and fetch-blob, stay in upstream.js, which is installed unmodified.

